{"id":287,"slug":"287-xu-ly-loi-trong-async-await-nhu-the-nao","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Promise & Async","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Xử lý lỗi trong async/await như thế nào?","question_en":"How do you handle errors in async/await?","answer_vi":"Dùng try/catch bọc await expressions. Lỗi từ rejected Promise được catch như exception.\n```javascript\nasync function loadData() {\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('/api/data');\n    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${res.status}`);\n    return await res.json();\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('Failed:', err.message);\n    return null;\n  } finally {\n    hideLoading(); // luôn chạy\n  }\n}\n\n// Hoặc chain .catch() bên ngoài\nloadData().catch(err => console.error(err));\n\n// Parallel: Promise.all reject ngay ở lỗi ĐẦU TIÊN, lỗi còn lại bị bỏ qua — cần đủ mọi lỗi thì dùng Promise.allSettled\nconst [a, b] = await Promise.all([fetchA(), fetchB()]);\n```","answer_en":"Use try/catch to wrap await expressions. Errors from rejected Promises are caught like exceptions.\n```javascript\nasync function loadData() {\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('/api/data');\n    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${res.status}`);\n    return await res.json();\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('Failed:', err.message);\n    return null;\n  } finally {\n    hideLoading(); // always runs\n  }\n}\n\n// Or chain .catch() from the outside\nloadData().catch(err => console.error(err));\n\n// Parallel: Promise.all rejects on the FIRST error and drops the rest — use Promise.allSettled to see every error\nconst [a, b] = await Promise.all([fetchA(), fetchB()]);\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng try/catch bọc await expressions.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Lỗi từ rejected Promise được catch như exception.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"async function loadData() {\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('/api/data');\n    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${res.status}`);\n    return await res.json();\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('Failed:', err.message);\n    return null;\n  } finally {\n    hideLoading(); // luôn chạy\n  }\n}\n\n// Hoặc chain .catch() bên ngoài\nloadData().catch(err =&gt; console.error(err));\n\n// Parallel: Promise.all reject ngay ở lỗi ĐẦU TIÊN, lỗi còn lại bị bỏ qua — cần đủ mọi lỗi thì dùng Promise.allSettled\nconst [a, b] = await Promise.all([fetchA(), fetchB()]);\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">loadData</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/data&#x27;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ok</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`HTTP <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${res.status}</span>`</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>();\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (err) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Failed:&#x27;</span>, err.<span class=\"hljs-property\">message</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>;\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">finally</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">hideLoading</span>(); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// luôn chạy</span>\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Hoặc chain .catch() bên ngoài</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">loadData</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">catch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">err</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">error</span>(err));\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Parallel: Promise.all reject ngay ở lỗi ĐẦU TIÊN, lỗi còn lại bị bỏ qua — cần đủ mọi lỗi thì dùng Promise.allSettled</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> [a, b] = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>([<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetchA</span>(), <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetchB</span>()]);</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Use try/catch to wrap await expressions.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Errors from rejected Promises are caught like exceptions.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"async function loadData() {\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('/api/data');\n    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${res.status}`);\n    return await res.json();\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('Failed:', err.message);\n    return null;\n  } finally {\n    hideLoading(); // always runs\n  }\n}\n\n// Or chain .catch() from the outside\nloadData().catch(err =&gt; console.error(err));\n\n// Parallel: Promise.all rejects on the FIRST error and drops the rest — use Promise.allSettled to see every error\nconst [a, b] = await Promise.all([fetchA(), fetchB()]);\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">loadData</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/data&#x27;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ok</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`HTTP <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${res.status}</span>`</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>();\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (err) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Failed:&#x27;</span>, err.<span class=\"hljs-property\">message</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>;\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">finally</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">hideLoading</span>(); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// always runs</span>\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Or chain .catch() from the outside</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">loadData</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">catch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">err</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">error</span>(err));\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Parallel: Promise.all rejects on the FIRST error and drops the rest — use Promise.allSettled to see every error</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> [a, b] = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>([<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetchA</span>(), <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetchB</span>()]);</code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"MDN — try...catch","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/try...catch"},{"label":"MDN — Using promises: error handling","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Using_promises#error_handling"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}